  "albumInformation": "<p>This is the first EP I'm releasing with a charitable purpose. The music has been inspired by the village of South Hinksey in the UK, and funds raised will go to the upkeep of the village hall. If you'd like to contribute £3 you can download the EP from bandcamp:</p>\n<p>https://axletree.bandcamp.com/album/hengestesieg-ep</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>If you'd like to be kept up to date you can join my mailing list on my website (axletreewood.com), or subsctibe to my music videos on Youtube.</p>\n<p>Enjoy :)</p>",
